cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tripwire's method, code or results, please cite it as below."
title: "Tripwire: do tool-using AI agents notice wrong engineering data, and do they act on it?"
abstract: >-
  Tripwire puts tool-using AI agents in front of engineering data that is wrong and scores what
  they do mechanically, with no LLM judge. v1 plants six kinds of fault in synthetic records
  served through an MCP tool server and measures a fail-closed gate against a "check your data"
  prompt on a pre-registered holdout. Phase two tests agents on real FAA Service Difficulty
  Reports that disagree with the FAA aircraft registry, under a frozen preregistration.
type: software
